{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03744","headline":"夏晚九成宫呈同僚 · 李峤","name":"夏晚九成宫呈同僚","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"碣馆分襄野，平台架射峰。\n英藩信炜烨，胜地本从容。\n林引梧庭凤，泉归竹沼龙。\n小轩恒共处，长坂属相从。\n野席兰琴奏，山台桂酒醲。\n一枰移昼景，六着尽宵钟。\n枚藻清词律，邹谈耀辩锋。\n结欢良有裕，联寀愧无庸。\n暂悦丘中赏，还希物外踪。\n风烟远近至，鱼鸟去来逢。\n月涧横千丈，云崖列万重。\n树红山果熟，崖绿水苔浓。\n愿以西园柳，长间北岩松。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李峤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03744.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03744","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}